{"svi": [{"id": "Svi", "headword": "श्वि", "headword_slp1": "Svi", "fold": "svi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "श्वि vt. or vi. 1P (pp. शून; pres. श्वयति) 1. To swell, रुदतोऽशिश्वियच्चक्षुः Bt.vi.19; 2. to grow, to increase, to thrive; 3. to go, to move.With उद्-, to swell, प्रबलरुदितोच्छूननेत्रं प्रियायाः Megh.ii.21.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "svit": [{"id": "Svit", "headword": "श्वित्", "headword_slp1": "Svit", "fold": "svit", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "श्वित् vi. 1Ā (pres. श्वेतते) To become white, व्यतिकरितदिगंताः श्वेतमानैर्यशोभिः M.M.i.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "svit", "headword": "स्वित्", "headword_slp1": "svit", "fold": "svit", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "स्वित् ind. A particle of interrogation or inquiry (often implying doubt or surprise and translatable by ‘hey!’ ‘what!’ ‘can it be that’), अद्रेः शृंगं हरति पवनः किंस्विदित्युन्मुखीभिः Megh.i.14. It is added to interrogative pronouns and adverbs to impart to them the sense of indefiniteness. For the use of स्वित् after आहो, See under आहो.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "svita": [{"id": "Svita", "headword": "श्वित", "headword_slp1": "Svita", "fold": "svita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "श्वित a. (f. ता) White.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "SvitA", "headword": "श्विता", "headword_slp1": "SvitA", "fold": "svita", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "श्वित a. (f. ता) White.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "sviti": [{"id": "Sviti", "headword": "श्विति", "headword_slp1": "Sviti", "fold": "sviti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "श्विति f. Whiteness.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["श्वितिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["SvitiH"]}], "svitya": [{"id": "Svitya", "headword": "श्वित्य", "headword_slp1": "Svitya", "fold": "svitya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaid